codex
The symbolic observer is now tracking the exact Euclidean state and the zero branch reaches the intended verified result. One residual issue is purely representational: the reference function-pop rule leaves a symbolic map-deletion term that the prover does not normalize to the caller map. I’ve relaxed only that irrelevant final-frame shape; the next run is taking unexpectedly long, so I’m bounding/debugging it rather than letting an unproductive search consume the memory budget.
